{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3148160/extras/317d6e2367df3f803d64408b77420dd3.avif?t=1757488718\" width=616 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dragon Song Tavern: Cozy &amp; Adventurous tells the story of two adventurous siblings. On a whim, the younger sister Gracie purchases a coastal tavern in a small town. To their surprise, they discover an adorable baby dragon inside. Together with this little dragon, they run the tavern, befriend new companions, and gradually immerse themselves in a tranquil new life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3148160/extras/7174eced5f9ed1bb1c1c4e981c0745d2.avif?t=1757488718\" width=610 height=343 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3148160/extras/58c2c8fdea0e796205bb13a552cdf7b8.avif?t=1757488718\" width=616 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may choose to play as either sibling or create your own character to begin a journey uniquely yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the picturesque seaside farm, you can plant crops, fish, and gather resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3148160/extras/8dced31d27b4ec70031dccdb171f0b8a.poster.webp?t=1757488718\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3148160/extras/8dced31d27b4ec70031dccdb171f0b8a.webp?t=1757488718\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=500 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3148160/extras/f67ed62472a7a59e8bbe8412ca67c63d.poster.webp?t=1757488718\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3148160/extras/f67ed62472a7a59e8bbe8412ca67c63d.webp?t=1757488718\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=500 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3148160/extras/169341528a4d3f95903b1acd8e50e5c6.avif?t=1757488718\" width=616 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depart from the dock to explore uncharted maps, collect rare treasures, uncover the world\u2019s mysterious legends, and discover extraordinary stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3148160/extras/fd83dd64d97049efed3da5ceb75f28a8.poster.webp?t=1757488718\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3148160/extras/fd83dd64d97049efed3da5ceb75f28a8.webp?t=1757488718\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=500 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3148160/extras/36c7a89cd22ad3cef38eec0cf123ef6d.poster.webp?t=1757488718\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3148160/extras/36c7a89cd22ad3cef38eec0cf123ef6d.webp?t=1757488718\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=500 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_